msgstr "返回类型"

#: cuda.tile.Array.shape:1 of
msgid "The number of elements in each of the |array|'s dimensions."
msgstr "|array| 在各个维度上的元素数量。"

#: ../../source/data/array.rst
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "返回值"

#: cuda.tile.Array.shape:3 cuda.tile.Array.strides:3 of
msgid ""
"Uses the array's index dtype (``int32``     by default). Dimensions may "
"be runtime values or compile-time     constants; see "
":class:`ArrayAnnotation`."
msgstr ""
"使用数组的索引 dtype（默认为 ``int32`` ）。各维度大小既可以是运行时值，也可以是编译期常量；参见 "
":class:`ArrayAnnotation` 。"

#: cuda.tile.Array.shape:5 cuda.tile.Array.strides:5 of
msgid "Uses the array's index dtype (``int32``"
msgstr "使用数组的索引 dtype（默认为 ``int32``"

#: cuda.tile.Array.shape:6 cuda.tile.Array.strides:6 of
msgid ""
"by default). Dimensions may be runtime values or compile-time constants; "
"see :class:`ArrayAnnotation`."
msgstr "）。各维度大小既可以是运行时值，也可以是编译期常量；参见 :class:`ArrayAnnotation` 。"

#: cuda.tile.Array.strides:1 of
msgid ""
"The number of elements to step in each dimension while traversing the "
"|array|."
msgstr "遍历 |array| 时，沿每个维度每前进一个索引所跨越的元素步长。"

#: cuda.tile.Array.ndim:1 of
msgid "The number of dimensions in the |array|."
msgstr "|array| 的维度数。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.slice:1 of
msgid "Creates a view of the |array| sliced along a single `axis`."
msgstr "创建沿单个 ``axis`` 对 |array| 进行切片后的视图。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.slice:3 of
msgid ""
"The returned array references the same underlying memory as |array|, but "
"with a restricted range from index `start` (inclusive) to `stop` "
"(exclusive) along the specified axis. No data is copied."
msgstr ""
"返回的数组与原 |array| 引用相同的底层内存，但在指定轴上的索引范围被限定为从 ``start`` （包含）到 ``stop`` "
"（不包含）。不会复制任何数据。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.slice:7 of
msgid ""
"`axis` must be a constant integer. Negative values are supported and "
"count from the last dimension (e.g., ``axis=-1`` refers to the last "
"axis)."
msgstr "``axis`` 必须是常量整数。支持负数值，从最后一个维度开始倒数（例如 ``axis=-1`` 表示最后一个轴）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.slice:10 of
msgid ""
"`start` and `stop` must be integers (scalars or 0D tiles). They must "
"satisfy ``0 <= start < N`` and ``start <= stop <= N``, where ``N`` is the"
" size of `array` along the sliced axis."
msgstr ""
"``start`` 和 ``stop`` 必须是整数（标量或零维 Tile），且必须满足 ``0 <= start < N`` 以及 "
"``start <= stop <= N`` ，其中 ``N`` 为数组沿被切片轴的长度。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.slice:14 of
msgid ""
"For example, consider a 2-dimensional array ``A`` of shape ``(M, N)``. "
"Slicing along axis 0 from `start` to `stop` produces an array of shape "
"``(stop - start, N)``:"
msgstr ""
"例如，考虑形状为 ``(M, N)`` 的二维数组 ``A`` 。沿轴 0 从 ``start`` 到 ``stop`` 切片后，会得到形状为 "
"``(stop - start, N)`` 的数组："

