#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:1 of
msgid "Creates a |tiled view| of this array with a fixed `tile_shape`."
msgstr "使用固定的 ``tile_shape`` 创建该数组的 |tiled view| 。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:3 of
msgid ""
"The resulting :class:`TiledView` partitions this array into a grid of "
"equally sized tiles."
msgstr "生成的 :class:`TiledView` 将该数组划分为由等尺寸 Tile 组成的网格。"

#: ../../source/data/array.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:6 of
msgid "The shape of each tile in the view. Must have the same rank as this array."
msgstr "视图中每个 Tile 的形状。其秩（维度数）必须与该数组相同。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:9 of
msgid ""
"The value used to pad tiles that extend beyond the array boundaries. By "
"default, the padding value is undetermined."
msgstr "用于填充超出数组边界部分的填充值。默认情况下，填充值为未确定（undetermined）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:13 of
msgid ""
"Number of elements between consecutive tile origins along each axis. Must"
" have the same rank as the array, or be ``None`` (default).  - ``None`` "
"or ``traversal_steps[i] == tile_shape[i]``: tiles   partition axis *i* "
"with no overlap or gaps. - ``traversal_steps[i] < tile_shape[i]``: tiles "
"overlap along   axis *i*. - ``traversal_steps[i] > tile_shape[i]``: gaps "
"between tiles   along axis *i*.  (Since CTK 13.3)"
msgstr ""

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:13 of
msgid ""
"Number of elements between consecutive tile origins along each axis. Must"
" have the same rank as the array, or be ``None`` (default)."
msgstr "沿每个轴相邻 Tile 原点之间相隔的元素数。必须与数组具有相同的秩，或为 ``None`` （默认）。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:17 of
msgid ""
"``None`` or ``traversal_steps[i] == tile_shape[i]``: tiles partition axis"
" *i* with no overlap or gaps."
msgstr ""
"``None`` 或 ``traversal_steps[i] == tile_shape[i]`` ：Tile 沿轴 *i* "
"无重叠且无间隔地划分。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:19 of
msgid "``traversal_steps[i] < tile_shape[i]``: tiles overlap along axis *i*."
msgstr "``traversal_steps[i] < tile_shape[i]`` ：Tile 沿轴 *i* 存在重叠。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:21 of
msgid "``traversal_steps[i] > tile_shape[i]``: gaps between tiles along axis *i*."
msgstr "``traversal_steps[i] > tile_shape[i]`` ：Tile 沿轴 *i* 之间存在间隔。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.Array.tiled_view:24 of
msgid "(Since CTK 13.3)"
msgstr "（自 CTK 13.3 起）"

